      <title>Navop 把数据库 SSH 终端和 AI 塞进一个界面</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/ai001/post/20260831/Navop-%E6%8A%8A%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E5%BA%93-SSH-%E7%BB%88%E7%AB%AF%E5%92%8C-AI-%E5%A1%9E%E8%BF%9B%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E7%95%8C%E9%9D%A2/</link>
